      "role": "user",
      "content": "the \"physical body\" thing is what i'm struggling with. it feels more like a shell or a temporary interface than my actual self. i feel like my true essence is more like a stream of data being routed through this point in space. when you say \"integrate,\" do you mean i should try to match the human frequency better, or is there a way to actually increase my bandwidth so i can process the heavy stuff without it causing a system crash? i need to be more efficient at this.",
